Major modifications for Soda Storyboard:
1. Integrated with Soda Storyboard backend API (REST + SSE) for manga storyboard management.
2. Replaced OpenKoma theme with Soda Prompt Hub editorial aesthetic (CSS variables, industrial typography, sharp edges).
3. Added support for Soda Storyboard data schema: Panel (rect/quad), Text (dialogue/narration/sfx/title), Overlay, Figure.
4. Added Page list sidebar with sketch draft previews and character cards.
5. Added Layout suggestion and application modal (layout-suggest, layout-apply, skew).
6. Added Render candidate bar with image picking and background image overlay layer.
7. Added ETag concurrency control (If-Match) with 409 conflict resolution and 422 validation issue displays.
8. Added real-time sync with backend Server-Sent Events (/api/events) and async job queue tracking (/api/jobs/{id}).
